From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: intelxe-build <build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:07:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] libdevice: __AsanLaunchInfo is a uptr pointer in both
 declarations

asan_rtl.hpp declared it as uint64_t *, asan_rtl.cpp defines it as
uptr * (uintptr_t): one type on Linux, two on macOS.
---
 libdevice/include/asan_rtl.hpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libdevice/include/asan_rtl.hpp b/libdevice/include/asan_rtl.hpp
index ac4b47fba..2a0fb48f9 100644
--- a/libdevice/include/asan_rtl.hpp
+++ b/libdevice/include/asan_rtl.hpp
@@ -13,5 +13,5 @@
 // Treat this header as system one to workaround frontend's restriction
 #pragma clang system_header
 
-extern SPIR_GLOBAL_VAR __SYCL_GLOBAL__ uint64_t *__SYCL_LOCAL__
+extern SPIR_GLOBAL_VAR __SYCL_GLOBAL__ uptr *__SYCL_LOCAL__
     __AsanLaunchInfo;
